OL,3,GNEWSAThey're part of British culture,
OL,4,Abut how safe are flight shows?
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery year, millions of Britons gather
OL,7,Fto watch aircraft - from warbirds to
OL,8,Fstunt planes - take to the skies at
OL,9,Fflight displays.
OL,11,FBut as one of the nation's most popular
OL,12,Foutdoor attractions, how safe are they?
OL,13,FTwo accidents in two days have raised
OL,14,Fthe question.
OL,16,FAt Stow Maries Great War Aerodrome,
OL,17,Fnear Maldon in Essex, a pilot suffered
OL,18,Flife-changing injuries during an
OL,19,Fincident on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
