OL,3,GNEWSAThey're part of British culture,
OL,4,Abut how safe are flight shows?
OL,5,
OL,6,FJust a day earlier, a vintage de
OL,7,FHavilland DH.88 Comet crashed during a
OL,8,Fdisplay at Shuttleworth, near
OL,9,FBiggleswade, Bedfordshire.
